<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Reich Security Main Office</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1939">1939</a>–<a href="/years/1945">1945</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as RSHA</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Reich Security Main Office (RSHA) was formed in September 1939 by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/heinrich-himmler">Heinrich Himmler</a> to combine the Security Police, including the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gestapo">Gestapo</a> and the criminal police, with the SS intelligence service, the SD. Headed by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/reinhard-heydrich">Reinhard Heydrich</a> and then Ernst Kaltenbrunner, it directed the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/einsatzgruppen">Einsatzgruppen</a> and, through Adolf Eichmann's office, organised the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/deportation">deportation</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/europe">Europe</a>'s <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jews">Jews</a> to the death camps.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/reich-security-main-office.jpg" alt="Reich Security Main Office" width="320" height="183" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Fornax · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stander_Chef_der_SiPo_und_SD_1942.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
